    "s136-hints-on-yoga:p52.s1"
   ],
   "quote": {
    "text": "In the beginning of your practice, you may get jerks of hands, legs, trunk and whole body",
    "cite": "s136-hints-on-yoga:p52.s1"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "backache-not-kundalini",
   "paraphrase": "Back pains and sensations are not Kundalini rising; do not read bodily symptoms as attainment.",
   "scope": [
    "all"
