    "s080-instructions-on-pranayama:p11.s3"
   ],
   "quote": {
    "text": "Always inhale and exhale very slowly. Do not make any sound",
    "cite": "s080-instructions-on-pranayama:p11.s1"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "ratio-1-4-2",
